      <span><span class="swatch" style="background:#d4690a"></span>$A_n(\varepsilon)$: tail bad</span>
      <span><span class="swatch" style="background:#6b4592"></span>$\limsup B_n$: exceptional set</span>
      <span><span class="swatch" style="background:#1f4a8c"></span>sample paths</span>
